+////  Documentation related to this project:                      ////
+////  - http://www.opencores.org/cores/uart16550/                 ////
+////                                                              ////
+////  Projects compatibility:                                     ////
+////  - WISHBONE                                                  ////
+////  RS232 Protocol                                              ////
+////  16550D uart (mostly supported)                              ////
+////                                                              ////
+////  Overview (main Features):                                   ////
+////  Defines of the Core                                         ////
+////                                                              ////
+////  Known problems (limits):                                    ////
+////  None                                                        ////
